WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:09.986
Sabulun Ruwa na Wanke Hannu da na Wanke Kwanoni ta Tsarin Kashi. Wannan shi ne babi na 2 na kwas ɗin.

2
00:00:10.357 --> 00:00:22.805
Yau za ki haɗa sabulun hannu mai laushi a bokiti, ki ƙara masa kauri ba tare da ɓata shi ba, ki kuma zaɓi sabulun kwanoni ta ainihin ƙirga faranti.

3
00:00:23.805 --> 00:00:31.839
Duk abin da kika gani yana hawa wannan ma'auni ana auna shi ne a matsayin kashi na haɗin duka.

4
00:00:32.164 --> 00:00:41.641
Ta haka takarda ɗaya tana aiki don gwajin kilogiram 2 ko haɗin kilogiram 200. Ninkawa kawai za ki yi.

5
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:51.998
Wannan tsarin farko ne don haɗin gwaji. Sinadari mai aiki ya kai 9.9%, matsakaicin adadi ga hannaye.

6
00:00:52.998 --> 00:01:04.543
Chiamaka a Enugu tana son kilogiram 10, kusan kwalabe 20 na mililita 500. Ta ninka kowane kashi da giram 10,000, ta raba da 100.

7
00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:15.925
Sannan ta haɗa kowane layi don tabbatar ya kai giram 10,000 daidai, ta kuma yi wa kowane nauyi alama yayin da take zubawa.

8
00:01:16.925 --> 00:01:28.034
Ki saka safar hannu da gilashin kariya kafin ki buɗe kwaɓin SLES ko man turare. Duka biyun suna iya ɓata fata da ido.

9
00:01:29.034 --> 00:01:40.227
Ga ganga mai tsabta. Ki auna ruwan, ki ajiye kusan 10% don daga baya, ki juya EDTA a ciki har ya narke.

10
00:01:40.643 --> 00:01:51.099
Yanzu kwaɓin SLES yana shiga, guntu-guntu, yayin da muciya ke tafiya a hankali. Ki juya a hankali don kada ki tayar da kumfar iska.

11
00:01:51.429 --> 00:01:57.771
Idan ya yi santsi babu dunƙule, ki ƙara CAPB da gilisarin ki juya har ya daidaita.

12
00:01:58.771 --> 00:02:05.580
Ki kalli ɗigon. Ki fara haɗa turaren da ɗan CAPB, don kada sabulun hannun ya yi dushi.

13
00:02:05.908 --> 00:02:08.704
Sannan ki ƙara preservative da kowane launi.

14
00:02:09.704 --> 00:02:18.184
Ki bar shi ya huta na minti 15, sannan ki tsoma takardar gwaji. Kina son kusan 5.5 zuwa 6.5.

15
00:02:18.649 --> 00:02:26.635
Idan ya yi sama, ki saukar da shi da ruwan citric acid, ta samfur tukuna, daidai yadda kika koya a babi na 1.

16
00:02:27.635 --> 00:02:36.608
Gishiri yana ƙara kauri har zuwa ƙoli, sannan ruwan ya sake yin tsululu, kuma ba za ki iya cire gishiri ba.

17
00:02:37.033 --> 00:02:45.811
Don haka Ruth a Jos ta auna samfurori huɗu na giram 200, ta saka wa kowanne gishiri daban.

18
00:02:46.309 --> 00:03:06.968
Kauri ya tashi har 1.5%, ya faɗi a 2.0%. Ƙolinta yana kusa da 1.5%, wanda ya dace da buƙatarta ta daƙiƙa 15 zuwa 25.

19
00:03:07.968 --> 00:03:22.831
Yanzu ki kalli yadda yake yin kauri. Ruth ta narkar da gishirinta giram 300 a cikin giram 1,200 na ruwan da ta ajiye, ta yi ruwan gishiri na 20%.

20
00:03:23.192 --> 00:03:33.227
Ta zuba shi kashi uku, tana juyawa tana gwaji bayan kowanne. Haɗin ya kai kusan daƙiƙa 20 ba tare da ya wuce ƙoli ba.

21
00:03:34.227 --> 00:03:46.632
Ki bar haɗin a rufe ya kwana don kumfar iska ta tashi. Sannan ki duba shi da buƙatunki da samfurinki na misali, ki cika kwalabe.

22
00:03:47.110 --> 00:03:54.041
Haɗin da ya kasa ana riƙe shi a gyara, ba a taɓa sayar da shi don ya kusa kyau ba.

23
00:03:55.041 --> 00:04:12.072
Sabulun kwanoni yana da aiki mafi wuya. A littafinta, Zainab a Kano ta gwada tsari biyu iri ɗaya: giram 2 na mai a kowane faranti, lita 5 na ruwan ɗumi, zubin mililita 5.

24
00:04:12.451 --> 00:04:24.998
Ta wanke har kumfa ya ƙare, ta ƙirga faranti. Tsari A ya fi tsada a kowace lita amma ya fi araha a kowane faranti, kuma ya fi na kasuwa. Ta zaɓi A.

25
00:04:25.998 --> 00:04:34.888
Ki gwada sabulun kwanonin ma. Ki riƙe shi kusan 6 zuwa 8, mai laushi ga hannayen da ke daɗewa cikin ruwa.

26
00:04:35.316 --> 00:04:45.918
Kada ki taɓa ƙara kostik soda ko soda ash don ƙarin ƙarfi. Yana ɓata fata kuma yana iya dusashe tukwanen aluminiyam.

27
00:04:46.918 --> 00:04:52.163
Dubi waɗannan kwalabe a kan tebur: kwalaben sabulu na ainihi masu rubutu.

28
00:04:52.546 --> 00:05:05.302
Kada ki taɓa amfani da tsofaffin kwalaben lemo ko na ruwa. Wani zai iya sha daga ciki. Ki buga "A ajiye nesa da yara" da layin taimakon gaggawa.

29
00:05:06.302 --> 00:05:17.253
Launukan kwalliya suna da ƙarfi sosai, don haka ki yi ruwan launi na 1% ki riƙa zuba shi maimakon haka.

30
00:05:17.668 --> 00:05:24.986
Idan wani abu ya lalace, ki canza abu ɗaya kawai a kowane samfurin gwaji ki rubuta shi.

31
00:05:25.986 --> 00:05:40.895
Yanzu ki bi darussan da ke ƙasa. Ki yi haɗin gwajinki na kilogiram 2, ki yi gwajin faranti naki, ki zana layin gishirinki. Lambobinki ne za su nuna miki abin da ke aiki.

